extract":"Jiangmen, alternately romanized in Cantonese as Kongmoon, is a prefecture-level city in Guangdong Province in southern China. It consists of three urban districts, Heshan, and the more rural Siyi, which is the ancestral homeland of approximately 4 million overseas Chinese. As of the 2020 census, Jiangmen had a total population of about 4,798,090. Its urban region, consisting of Pengjiang, Jianghai, and Heshan, had 2,657,062 inhabitants.","image":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/d/df/%E7%9C%BA%E6%9C%9B%E6%B1%9F%E9%97%A8%E5%B8%82%E5%8C%BA%28%E8%A5%BF%E5%8D%97%E6%96%B9%E5%90%91%29.jpg/330px-%E7%9C%BA%E6%9C%9B%E6%B1%9F%E9%97%A8%E5%B8%82%E5%8C%BA%28%E8%A5%BF%E5%8D%97%E6%96%B9%E5%90%91%29.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=api&utm_content=thumbnail","url":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Jiangmen"},"twins":["Q49243","Q137271","Q11462"],"climate":{"temp":[14.8,17.5,20.6,24.1,26.9,28,28.5,28.4,27.2,24.1,20.5,15.6],"rain":[41,35,82,131,275,325,222,263,201,65,36,27],"cloud":[61,72,75,75,77,81,73,74,67,50,54,53]}}